comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-08T10:54:15.899Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status searches for action-aware stale runtime classifier and stale runtime read commands found no matching implementation item. This follow-up was discovered during final diff review of pm-1eted6 and tightens that completed primitive without reopening its already verified baseline."
  "2026-08-08T11:10:27.292Z","harness:codex","Verification evidence: focused packaged/runtime tests pass 57 tests before the expanded matrix; the final repository run passes all 453 files / 7,047 tests at exact 50,251/50,251 statements, 36,654/36,654 branches, 10,318/10,318 functions, and 48,655/48,655 lines. Full lint passes ESLint, zero clone detection, 100% docstrings, package/SDK parity, refusal inventories, token/context and tracker ratchets, registry validation, SDK surface, and performance floors; typecheck also passes."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-08T11:10:26.777Z","harness:codex","A command-name mutation allowlist is insufficient for a universal CLI: compatibility fences need action-level semantics for mixed commands and must test both false-positive read refusal and false-negative write exposure."
